====== ASUS WL-500g Deluxe ======

{{section>meta:infobox:432_warning#infobox_for_dataentries&noheader&nofooter&noeditbutton}}

The router is sometimes called Asus WL-500GX or Asus WL-500g Deluxe V. An evolution of the previous [[toh/asus/wl500g|WL-500g]] superseded by the [[toh:asus:wl-500gp|WL-500g Premium]].

===== Supported Versions =====
There is a single hardware release. It's fully supported in White Russian (starting at least in RC4) and in Kamikaze 7.09-8.09 using the brcm-2.4 target. Starting from BackFire 10.03, it works with the brcm47xx target (2.6/3.x kernel and free b43 driver), however, wifi may be slow and unstable depending on your firmware version (see [[https://forum.openwrt.org/viewtopic.php?pid=109207|forum]]).
